  <h2>DQ Breakfast Availability — Important Note</h2>
  <p>Dairy Queen breakfast is available at <strong>select locations only</strong> — primarily in the U.S. South and Midwest. Many DQ locations in northern states or urban areas do not serve breakfast at all. Always call ahead or check the DQ app before making a special trip for breakfast.</p>
  <h2>Country Breakfast Platter vs. Other DQ Breakfast Options</h2>
  <p>The Country Breakfast Platter is the most complete and highest-calorie breakfast on the DQ menu. If you want a lighter option, choose the Breakfast Burrito ($3.49, 380 cal). If you want something sweet, the Buttermilk Pancake Platter ($5.49, 680 cal) is the alternative. The Country Breakfast Platter is the choice for guests who want a full, substantial Southern-style breakfast.</p>
